{"title":"Thak Shield Boss","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Thak Spearman, Thak Footman</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>A <b>gear-line reagent</b>: a <b>catalyst</b> when crafting <b>shields</b>, making superior and flawless come up more often. One reagent lasts <b>10 crafts</b>; a failed craft uses none.</p><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Thak</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">Thak Spearman</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">Thak Reaver</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord\">Thak Warlord</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 6 of 493 looted corpses (1/82)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/82<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 5 of 990 looted corpses (1/198)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/198<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"thak-shield-boss\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/c3fce956c40029a7b24d.svg\" alt=\"Thak Shield Boss\"></div><h3>Thak Shield Boss</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 10:28:22 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}